  "evidence": "TEXT_E: \"Get Brexit done\" outside the single market/customs union/ECJ with UK control over laws, borders and trade; oppose second referendums; strengthen the Union. Law and order: 20,000 more police, expanded stop-and-search, tougher sentencing, 10,000 extra prison places, parole reform, powers on unauthorised encampments. Immigration: Australian-style points-based system, reduce low‑skilled migration, five‑year wait for benefits, higher NHS surcharge, clamp down on health tourism. Constitution: voter ID, keep First Past the Post, review courts/HR Act/judicial review. Defence: exceed NATO 2%, maintain Trident, legal protections for veterans.\nTEXT_C: Remain in EU via People’s Vote; humane immigration and a Ministry for Sanctuary; end hostile environment. Strong equality agenda including LGBTIQA+ rights and self‑ID. Justice/drugs: halve prison population, restorative justice, legal cannabis, prescription heroin, pardons for past possession. Democratic liberalisation: proportional representation, votes at 16, Citizens’ Assemblies, Digital Bill of Rights. Defence shift: cancel Trident, end arms export promotion. Core framing around a climate/ecological emergency and expansive social liberalisation.",
